		new CrucibleGuideFight("King Ahriman Piece","Elite",new string[2] { "King Ahriman", "Ahriman" },new int[3] { 31, 50, 13 },new string[4] { "Start with Geshunpest for Scouring Ash, then swap to Gigantoad, a solid tank here that can tank for a while.", "Kill the Roulette hourglass while the cursor is not pointing at you; with Doom resistance this can be used to kill adds.", "Double Vision works like World of Darkness: stand in the half opposite your debuff. The debuff shows a second or two before the cast goes off. When the summon happens, kill the adds fast, look away from the Ahriman and cleanse the burns; Meteor is solid.", "Release a pet whose rank is divisible by 5 before Curtains for Rank 5 if needed, otherwise it dies. For Flare run to a wall away from your pet. Then it repeats until dead." },new string[1] { "Cleanse" }) {
